        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_02",
      "hash64": "AF56200A305FCE83",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要讓我看[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和哪一隻\\n寶可夢有多友好呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_03",
      "hash64": "AF561F0A305FCCD0",
      "text": "我看看喔……[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和\\n[VAR 0x0102(0001)]的友好度是……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_04",
      "hash64": "AF56260A305FD8B5",
      "text": "最佳拍檔非你們莫屬！！\\n你們能遇到彼此很幸福吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_05",
      "hash64": "AF56250A305FD702",
      "text": "你們感情好得沒話說！\\n而且彼此都很珍惜對方呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_06",
      "hash64": "AF56240A305FD54F",
      "text": "嗯！你們的關係非常友好！\\n能陪伴在[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳身邊，牠看起來很開心！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_07",
      "hash64": "AF56230A305FD39C",
      "text": "看來你們感情很好。\\n不過相信還有進步空間！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_08",
      "hash64": "AF562A0A305FDF81",
      "text": "你們的友情正開始萌芽！\\n相信接下來友情會更加茁壯的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_09",
      "hash64": "AF56290A305FDDCE",
      "text": "嗯～你們彼此的關係很普通！\\n今後的發展真叫人期待！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_10",
      "hash64": "AF529C0A305CB860",
      "text": "你們是不是剛遇見彼此？\\n在一起時還有一點點尷尬？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_11",
      "hash64": "AF529D0A305CBA13",
      "text": "你們是怎麼回事！？\\n竟然一點都不友好耶……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_12",
      "hash64": "AF529E0A305CBBC6",
      "text": "作為友好的證明！\\n我給牠個好東西！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_046_system_01",
      "hash64": "4DBAA28FEF755C82",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0102(0001)]\\n獲得了好友獎章！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_13",
      "hash64": "AF529F0A305CBD79",
      "text": "歡迎隨時來讓我看寶可夢喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_14",
      "hash64": "AF52A00A305CBF2C",
      "text": "和寶可夢在一起的話，\\n就會慢慢地變得越來越親密。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
